<title>CHINA: Bank of China considers Yankee issue - official.</title>
<headline>Bank of China considers Yankee issue - official.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state-owned commercial Bank of China is considering a dollar bond issue, officials said on Thursday, but declined to give a timetable or an amount for the issue.</p>
<p>&quot;We are always following the market to see whether we should issue a Yankee bond,&quot; one bank official said.</p>
<p>&quot;As regards the short term, we have not yet reached any decision,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>He declined to give further details.</p>
</text>
